  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis PR is test-only. It changes no file in `src/`.\n\nEach slow test of `keep_law` and `level_links` was one loop over its cases. Each case is now its own test. The cases are in a module with the old test name, so a filter on the old name still selects them. libtest runs the cases in parallel. Each case builds its own world.\n\nNo assert and no expected value changed. The multiset of assert and expect lines is the same before and after (diff of the sorted lines is empty). The Gate map headers did not change.\n\n## `#[test]` count\n\n| File | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| `crates/app/tests/keep_law.rs` | 8 | 14 |\n| `crates/app/tests/keep_law/stock_source.rs` (new) | - | 13 |\n| `crates/app/tests/keep_law/mcp.rs` (new) | - | 4 |\n| **keep_law binary** | **8** | **31** |\n| `crates/app/tests/level_links.rs` | 7 | 22 |\n| `crates/app/tests/level_links/choices.rs` (new) | - | 3 |\n| **level_links binary** | **7** | **25** |\n\nNo test is ignored or un-ignored. Each file is below 400 lines.\n\n## Readings (debug, one binary alone on this machine)\n\n| Binary | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| keep_law | 82.0 s (5 tests over 60 s) | 68.0 s |\n| level_links | 73.2 s (1 test 73.9 s) | 36.6 s |\n\n## Not changed, and why\n\n- `whole_model_pocket`: the binary runs in 2.1 s since #1716. A split gives no gain.\n- `lathe_field_sim` (108.8 s): I split the groove test and measured 113.4 s. The slowest test (`multi_pass_contour_simulates_with_meridian_parity`, about 107 s) is one field-engine job. About 69 s of it is `field_view_with`. A smaller time needs a lighter fixture or a heavy-lane move. The first can weaken the check, so I reverted the split.\n- `shared_face_bodies.rs`: open PRs #1772 and #1780 change it. A second PR splits it.\n\n## How tested\n\n- `keep_law`: 31 passed.\n- `level_links`: 25 passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --test keep_law --test level_links -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nNot exercised: the full quick gate, `cargo fmt`, the release heavy lanes.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: high\n\nRefs #1715\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
